      "context": "/ (requireStaffSession + overview:read) — Operations centre for staff, drawn after the admin prototype: glass bento tiles over the aurora — what needs action first, then KPIs, listens, the track pipeline, reports by type, accounts and the audit trail. Every tile opens its analysis. The sidebar footer switches the language (English ↔ Українська), cycles the theme (Dark → Light → Dim) and collapses the panel to a rail. Not-found is not drawn: unknown admin routes redirect to /. Overlays (bell, profile menu, command palette, menu) are drawn in the flow under the top bar; the prototype shows them floating. · no mobile frame: phones have no side panel; the menu tab opens it as a sheet (see Menu open)"
    },
